# PUBG Shorts — Template KS1A (Kills + Assists)

Use when the user asks for **KS1A**, "with assists", or kill shots **plus assist kills**.

Follow global GPU/thermal hard rules.

## Include (on top of KS1)
- Moments where **I knocked** an enemy
- Moments where **I killed / finished** an enemy
- Moments where I got an **ASSIST** (damage that helps a teammate finish)

## Exclude
- Same as KS1 (no Chicken Dinner, no spectator, no other players' unrelated feed)
- Bare map "ASSISTED" counter alone without a fight banner

## Title / tags
- Moment type: kill + assist montage
- Hashtags can add `#Assist` / `#TeamPlay`; still omit `#ChickenDinner` unless win confirmed
